{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1s77EM6RBCmNvwNZEGk", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off after filing two bugs. The developer confirmed both and logged them. I did not test rotation or whether changes persist after leaving a file and coming back.\n\n**Bugs filed**\n- **Number bases:** results are scaled by the radix. `15 dec in hex` shows `0x96` instead of `0xF`. `10 dec in bin` shows `0b1100100`, `64 dec in oct` shows `0o1200`, and `255 dec in hex` shows `0x9F6`.\n- **Date gaps:** datetime ranges show a day count that is one too high. Line 1 shows `45 y 2 mo 19 d 20 h 17 min 9 s` where I calculate 18 d. Line 2 shows 15 d where I calculate 14 d.\n\n**Looked correct**\n- **Temperatures:** all four lines, including -65 °F to -53.89 °C.\n- **Temperature sums:** all three lines. I did not independently verify `10 celsius + 18 fahrenheit` = 2.22 °C.\n- **Time differences:** all three lines.\n- **Remainders and Percentages:** every result matched my own calculation.\n- **Expenses and Monthly budget:** the totals and `grand_total` matched.\n- **Home screen list:** all nine files appear, in the expected newest-first order.\n\nThe date-only line in Date gaps (`date(2024, 1, 1) to date(2024, 1, 8)` = 1 wk) looked right. I signed off with confidence 0.7."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 309, "cache_read_input_tokens": 25283, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 309}, "output_tokens": 495, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "c40e7c23-39b8-4c32-8cca-aea912af5605", "uuid": "8874efd6-0aaa-408e-a303-714319f83a46", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:21:31.500Z", "request_